
==============================================================================
Tooling capability check
==============================================================================

  pass              leak                use-after-free      buffer-overflow     
  AddressSanitizer  MISSED              detected            detected            
  CRT debug heap    detected            MISSED              MISSED              

  AddressSanitizer misses leaks on this toolchain, as expected:
  MSVC ships no LeakSanitizer. This is why the CRT debug-heap
  pass exists, and why running ASan alone would not close the
  Phase F item.
  All of leak, use-after-free, buffer-overflow are covered by at least one pass.

