Verdict
==============================================================================
  AddressSanitizer     clean
  CRT debug heap       clean

  No use-after-free, buffer overflow, double free or heap leak across 40 cycles of 12 concurrent requests, with prefix sharing, copy-on-write, preemption and cache eviction all exercised. The driver also asserts every cycle that the free list returns to its starting size, which is the logical-leak half that no sanitizer checks.
